WEBVTT

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:42.330
There should be someone
here by the name of Chrono.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:45.290
My apologies, but who may I say is asking?

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:51.670
If you say "Duke," he'll know.

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:52.840
Duffau...

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:55.170
Chrono...

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:57.300
A devil?

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:01.180
That's right! He's a pursuer!

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:02.930
Steiner, back away!

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:05.220
Don't be so hasty!

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:08.770
I did not come here to fight you.

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:09.940
What?

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:13.400
Sinner Chrono,and you humans...

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:18.030
We are all incomplete creations,
cursed by the number six.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:21.120
Hence, we have a common enemy.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.120
Enemy?

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:26.450
Let us defeat the Sinner Aion together!

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:29.500
And for the sake of
retrieving the lost darkness,

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:35.250
to once again place the head of
Pandemonium beneath the earth,

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:39.510
Chrono, and you humans, I want your help.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:54.820
We cannot approve of this.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:57.650
For we servants of the Lord,

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:00.450
actually working together
with them is out of the question.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:05.990
But it is not inconceivable that they are so
desperate that they don't have any choice.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:11.540
Isn't it much more likely that they
have some sort of hidden agenda?

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:12.830
After all, they are

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.540
The one called Duffau...

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:16.250
...he holds the title of Duke,

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:20.090
and it appears that he wields
considerable influence in Pandemonium.

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:23.510
Should we not first listen
carefully to what he has to say?

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:28.600
This incident occurred because

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:31.390
the New York branch
welcomed that which is not human.

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:34.060
We are well aware of that.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:37.610
But there is something we
would like for you to keep in mind.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:39.820
What is that, Sister Kate?

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:45.450
Chrono has contributed
significantly to the Magdalene Order.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:48.950
The number of cases that have
been solved thanks to him is not small.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:53.580
And this may be a good
chance for us, Chairman.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:59.210
Until now, we have only been
able to learn about Aion and his plans

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:03.220
from scraps of information and deduction.

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:08.680
But now, we can obtain
an unsurpassed source of information.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.180
Should we not ally with them?

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:13.810
You can't be...

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:17.520
For us to settle this by
merely saying "he betrayed our Lord"

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:21.610
would only demonstrate our own prejudice.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:26.490
The ones that taught us that,
were Chrono and Sister Rosette.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:29.160
I will trust their judgment!

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:34.370
I hope that this doesn't become the
greatest mistake since the fruit of knowledge.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.210
Even still, we must have
the courage to take this step forward.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.460
Somehow, you've come
to be similar to Rosette.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:49.140
We won't know anything unless we try.

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:52.180
I think that if she were here,
she'd be sure to say that.

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:07.070
Lord Duffau...

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:08.870
How is Pandemonium?

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:12.750
I can't keep my eyes open.
There's too much light.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:13.910
I see.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:16.330
What about Chrono?

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.500
Wait until dusk.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.960
He will come here, bearing the answer.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:29.350
Those clothes look good on you.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:34.560
What, these? I borrowed them from Satella.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:37.560
I was contacted by the Council.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.770
Then Sister Kate...

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:42.480
She said that she'll leave it to us.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:46.240
The Council hasn't accepted it,
but she'll take care of it somehow.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.820
It's strange, isn't it?

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:51.990
Even though I'm so far away,
I'm causing problems for Sister Kate again.

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.250
That's not true at all.

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.040
You know, I don't know why.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:03.420
I never thought to find out
why Chrono is called a Sinner.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:14.470
Pandemonium's head?

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:16.810
What is it?

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:21.480
That bearded guy said something,
but what in the world did you guys do?!

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:29.030
Let's go to a free world.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:31.070
Aion, you...

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:34.450
That's right, it's Pandemonium's head.

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:38.250
This is a revolution!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.040
We're going to destroy eternity!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.920
The era of the old codgers ends today!

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.680
Aion...

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:54.850
You're late! Man, what were you doing?

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:56.220
Shader...

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:57.520
So you've come.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.810
Are we really doing this?

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:04.820
Are you prepared to take
the plunge into freedom?

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.650
Our dream...

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:11.200
That's right. For that purpose,
nothing is beyond you, right?

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:13.280
Is this really all right?

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.790
Hey! Let's do this already!

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:24.460
I want to kill. I want to kill more.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:28.170
Chrono, I'll ask one more time.

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:31.130
Are you prepared to
take the plunge into freedom?

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.260
Then that's fine.

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:44.810
The one that fell from
Heaven became Pandemonium.

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:47.400
A fallen angel? It couldn't be...

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:50.820
Pandemonium hated God,

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:54.740
and granted knowledge to man,
who were made in His image.

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:59.660
Heaven and Earth and man formed
a never-ending cycle of faith and hatred,

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:02.210
and became the order we call this world.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:03.330
That can't...

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:11.050
Aion said that he wanted to change this
order into a world where desire is not a sin.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:14.470
When desire is born, then,
and only then, will hope shine.

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:19.390
Just as devils are necessary so
that Heaven's authority can be conveyed.

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:25.230
That's why Aion said he
wanted to be free of Heaven's yoke.

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:28.020
Let's go to a free world.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.570
But the price of freedom was...

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:35.360
No, actually, that's what Aion wanted.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:43.080
Aion, what have you done?

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.540
What's wrong, making a face like that?

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:49.000
There's no one left
to challenge us anymore.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:57.510
Look, Pandemonium
can't say anything anymore.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.930
We're free!

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:03.140
Are you planning on
destroying the darkness?!

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:06.900
Why are you getting mad, Chrono?

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:10.190
Burn...Burn...

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:11.610
This is great!

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:15.740
I'm looking forward to everything that's
going to happen from here on, you know?

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:19.870
You bastards...

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:22.950
Do you understand what you've done?!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.210
You're late, Duffau.

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:31.960
Aion,so it's you.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.640
So now the old codgers show up?

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:44.060
Old codgers? No, these guys are prey!

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.270
They can drop dead!

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:57.240
Let's go, Chrono. You're an accomplice too.

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:59.780
You're going to help us out.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:11.040
That smarts!

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:17.170
I have you!

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:18.430
Aion!

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:23.180
Chrono, put the head back!

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:24.470
It's not too late yet!

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.850
This is a revolution!

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:34.070
You don't understand anything!

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:39.400
Kill them all! Let none survive!
Don't leave even a single legion!

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.350
Oh, here you are.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:08.270
I heard that you're going to 'Cisco

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:14.570
Yes, Sister Kate said that
she wanted us to support Rosette.

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:20.030
About that,
I want you to give these to Rosette.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:25.910
The fight will probably
become even fiercer from here on.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:30.580
With that in mind, I made some
Gospel and some Gospel-spec clips.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:34.130
Of course, I've readied some for you too.

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:36.040
Thank you very much!

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:38.550
Rosette will be happy too!

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:40.840
You girls stay firm as well.

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:41.680
Yes, Sir!

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:45.430
We're all here because we've
been chosen by Minister Remington.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:48.600
We understand our
mission quite well, Elder.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:50.680
We're going to go and do our best!

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.060
I see, I see...

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:56.650
Things are going to get lonely here too.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:11:59.740
Elder...

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:03.950
After all, you've all grown up so splendidly.

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.320
What are you doing?!

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:07.450
The Virgin Mary is watching!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:12.000
Lord, please forgive these girls,
who would strike a helpless old man

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.080
Everything is open to the Lord!

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:15.080
Ow!

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:04.340
I'm Gilliam, from
the Magdalene Order's West Coast branch.

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:06.640
Sister Kate asked me to
come here and stand witness,

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:09.350
and to cooperate with you.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:13.560
I've prepared a complete set
of Militia equipment. It's in the car.

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:15.390
Please use it.

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:17.150
Thank you very much.

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.650
I'm Sister Rosette.

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:23.360
You're Chrono, right?

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.700
I've also repaired the equipment box.

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:33.370
Have you come to a decision?

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:39.500
The Magdalene Order will abide
by Sister Rosette and Chrono's decision!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.510
Can you hear it?

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:54.310
The voice of desire...

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.480
It's a good era, isn't it?

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:58.690
Lady Shader has called for you.

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:00.650
She says that
the preparations are finished.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.500
Good morning!

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.710
Oh, Fi, my dear...

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.170
What?

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:30.340
Thank you, big sister.

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:32.850
Oh my, oh my... You're close, aren't you?

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:33.930
Damn.

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.430
Let me see.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:36.560
Yes, Sir!

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:40.600
I've finally finished it.

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:43.940
The way for that which is
incomplete to become complete.

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:46.400
It was pretty difficult.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.030
It would have been nice if

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:50.860
they had written in words
that were a little easier to understand.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:55.240
I did quite a bit
of planning. It was really tough.

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:59.750
The shining wings that
are guided by the seven virtues...

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:06.250
Forgiveness for the fallen angels,
as is spoken of in the Book of Atonement.

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:10.380
When Pandemonium's
head, six of the Apostles,

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.430
and the seven virtues are assembled,

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:16.100
the drops of Atonement will
be born in the great river of souls.

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:20.440
At that time, Heaven will become Earth,
and Earth will become Heaven.

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.560
Time will once again paint a spiral.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:28.240
The other ending to
the apocalypse is finally coming into view.

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:30.490
All that's left is the song of charity!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:35.620
Chrono and Mary of Magdalene
will be bringing it soon.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:40.620
Then let's have a welcoming party!
I'll be in charge of reception!

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:44.290
Even still,
Joshua possesses incredible power.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:47.800
I wouldn't have been able to make
this magic circle if he weren't here.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:53.930
Lord Aion, I would like to
take Lord Joshua back to his room.

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:56.850
He seems very tired.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:59.980
I'm all right, big sister.

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:02.390
No, you mustn't push yourself.

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:06.150
You humans are an eyesore!

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:10.990
Rizel was as good as killed
by this guy! For a human like this!

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:14.320
Genai, why are you getting mad?

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:17.870
Please stop! Please release your hand!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:20.950
Lord Joshua has a vital mission!

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:26.290
Hey, since when have you been
able to talk to your master like that?

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.300
Calm down, Genai.

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.340
Getting pent up, are we?

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:43.480
Thank you, big sister.

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:47.520
In the end, I'm always
being protected by you, aren't I?

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.490
We have no time.

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:57.410
Through Aion's theft of
the head of Pandemonium,

00:16:57.410 --> 00:17:01.080
the light of Heaven is in
the process of flowing into the darkness.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:04.460
With the vanishing of the darkness,
Heaven will once again lack balance,

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:07.960
and will probably bring
disaster to the human world.

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:16.890
Chrono, he's gathering all of
the Apostles. What are his intentions?

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:23.560
I don't know what he really had in mind.

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:27.940
He simply said over and over
that he would become the Creator.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.570
By destroying the world?

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:32.530
I won't let him do that.

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:37.280
This is like another contract, isn't it?

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:38.240
Don't do it!

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.030
Satella...

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:43.790
What are you thinking?

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:45.830
Relying on a devil so quickly...

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:48.880
You're no different
from a devil worshipper.

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:51.040
Exactly what is it that you have faith in?

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:53.340
This.

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:57.800
The rumored watch of life...

00:17:57.800 --> 00:18:01.180
So you have no time either.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:03.850
But I don't regret it.

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:07.690
I'm the one that has
to settle this with Aion!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:14.230
If someone has to fight,
then it's all right if it's me, right?

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:20.570
I will fight, together with you.

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.580
Such noble words.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:27.500
You truly deserve
the appellation Mary of Magdalene.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:32.000
What do you mean?
Aion calls me that too.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.170
Were you unaware?

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:41.800
You too were granted power
by Heaven, not just your younger brother.

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:45.350
What are you saying? There's no way.

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:50.480
I don't have power
like Joshua, or wings like Azmaria.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:54.480
Mary who brings the light,
as you are called by the church...

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:58.570
You, whose delicate fate is
about to be possessed by darkness,

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:02.780
because your true form has been twisted.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:09.710
Soon, marks will be
engraved into your body.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:12.540
The marks that will protect you.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:14.040
Marks?

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:21.340
Minister Gilliam,thank you very much.

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:25.350
Please, for the time being,
take care of Rosette and the others.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:32.150
You're pretty capable too,
Sister Kate, to challenge the Council.

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:34.610
Sooner or later,
it was going to end up like this.

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:37.280
Ever since the day
we took responsibility for Chrono...

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:39.570
It seems like something
about you has changed too.

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:44.820
And about Rosette...
Duffau said something that worries me.

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:47.290
Wait, Rosette!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:50.370
Are you really all right with this?

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:54.460
I am.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:59.670
The devils will become our
greatest source of information.

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:01.880
Source of information?

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:04.390
And clues about your older sister too.

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:09.680
And so, we'll impose
on you for a while longer.

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:13.350
Oh, and I want to take a bath
before bed, so please take care of it!

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:15.360
Yes, Lady Rosette.

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:21.030
Goodness. I'm going to bill all these
expenses to the Magdalene Order, all right?

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:24.820
Rosette is persistent, isn't she?

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:27.450
That's why I want to stay by her side.

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:30.040
What are you talking about?

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.660
Oh, nothing.

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:38.380
What does he mean, marks?

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:52.350
Soon, marks will be
engraved into your body.

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:56.480
Rosette? Is something the matter?

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:59.230
No, it's nothing.
